<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-recorder-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Before a construction grant, the exact schema, helper references and future two-file scope are independently reviewed. After construction, execute the real two-file fixture in the declared mode2 runtime, including concurrent child attempts on one private lock and a disposable process interruption/restart. Cover retained incomplete observations, UTC rollback with monotonic duration, null failure/interrupted acceptance, exact deduplication, unknown identities, all resource/privacy/refusal boundaries and default-ledger nonmutation. Tests may launch only fixed fixture Node/flock processes; the exported recorder never executes arbitrary child work. Passing fixtures do not admit telemetry or publish completion." <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-recorder> .
<urn:usf:requirement:job-lifecycle-recorder-validation> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:job-lifecycle-recorder> .
